  <h2>Purpose and operator</h2>
  <p>Hermes is operated by Liz Liu as a personal, locally hosted AI system. It retrieves and organizes subscription-related emails from the owner's Gmail account for personal AI-assisted analysis.</p>

  <h2>Private access and authorization</h2>
  <p>Hermes is intended solely for its owner's private use. No public registration, hosted service, or access for other users is offered. The public pages on this website are informational.</p>
  <p>Gmail access requires the owner's authorization through Google OAuth. Use must comply with Google's applicable terms and policies. Access may be revoked at any time through the owner's Google Account.</p>

  <h2>Data handling</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/hermes/privacy">Hermes Privacy Policy</a> describes how Gmail data is accessed, used, stored, shared, and deleted. The owner is responsible for managing the local system and reviewing the privacy terms of any AI services used in the workflow.</p>

  <h2>AI-generated output</h2>
  <p>AI-generated summaries and analyses may contain errors, omit details, or misinterpret email content. The owner should check the original emails before relying on an output or making a decision.</p>

  <h2>Availability and responsibility</h2>
  <p>Hermes is provided as is, without guarantees of accuracy, availability, or uninterrupted operation, to the extent permitted by applicable law. Its operation depends on the owner's local environment and third-party services, which may change or become unavailable.</p>

  <h2>Stopping use and changes</h2>
  <p>The owner may stop using Hermes and revoke its Gmail access at any time. Revoking access stops future authorized retrieval; previously saved data must be deleted separately as described in the privacy policy.</p>
  <p>These terms may be updated if the application's purpose or operation changes. The date above identifies the latest revision.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For questions about Hermes or these terms, use the contact information in the <a href="/hermes/privacy#contact">Hermes Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
</HermesPage>
